    "Native phase sheets show gentle consistent tube sway over stationary support. No loop pose difference was found; finite support tests confirm all sampled tube rings remain seated. Playback GIFs are supplied from12 original samples; continuous playback was not claimed as a separate live visual inspection.",
    "Source phone context preserves palette and mouths but high magenta emphasis remains strong beside the yellow craft. Candidate should gain soft volume while keeping scene hierarchy controlled.",
    "Repeated density confirms a tall1-cell prop can occlude the next row. This is ordinary registered depth overlap; it does not create a modular floor seam requirement.",
    "Both prescribed headless modes show equivalent visible layout. Decoded browser images differ by at most1 RGB unit and0 alpha in these bounded controls; equality is not claimed."
